            "sid": "ECC 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tana, we mwanake, wananĩ waku, na ngoo yaku ĩkũtan’ye mĩthenya ya wana waku, na kinya nzĩanĩ sya ngoo yaku, na kwonanĩ kwa metho maku; ĩndĩ manya we, Ngai akakũete ũsilĩlonĩ ũndũ wa maũndũ asu onthe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
